      {
        "t": "chr",
        "v": [
          "\n-  We classified 4 files: 4 data.\n-  We found 4 tabular data files and extracted 2 columns from 3 of them.\n-  We grouped the files into 1 study group (ex1).\n-  The study-group step did not get an answer for 4 files (the model request failed); they were grouped by the fallback rules instead.\n-  1 file read as a table but is not a usable rectangular dataset (coding.csv: 100% of columns are free text, not variables). No columns were extracted and they were not sent to the LLM. Share the underlying data as a plain rectangular table (one header row, one column per variable) with a codebook: coding.csv. We ran automated data-quality checks on 2 columns and found no issues."
        ]
